# TypeScript taste

Apply learnings from `.agents/taste/typescript/taste.md` when editing TypeScript:

- Prefer **named exports** unless re-exporting a library default.
- Default git branch for shashank-sn repos is **`initial`** — not main/master.

When taste conflicts with an explicit project rule in `taste-*.mdc`, project rules win.
